	)
	(text "1. U1 is powered from a 5 V adapter on its own USB-C port.\n    Its 3V3 pin feeds J3 and R3, and its 5V pin stays\n    unconnected. Do not connect +VPUMP to either.\n2. Common ground: pump supply (-) is wired to U1 GND.\n3. Polarized parts: D1 band (cathode) and C1 (+) to +VPUMP.\n4. Q1 IRLZ44N, TO-220 front view, left to right: G, D, S.\n5. R2 holds the gate low so the pump stays off while U1\n    powers up.\n6. R3 pulls SOIL_ADC up to 3V3, so a disconnected\n    sensor reads full scale instead of floating.\n7. Fit C1 close to J1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.95 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e4f6ad0b-53a5-54a2-8895-cb03ce18a968")
	)
